# Trivy ignore file — reviewed, documented exceptions only.
#
# Each entry MUST carry a reason and reference the relevant ARCHITECTURE.md
# section. These are accepted *portfolio* trade-offs; TIGHTEN for prod.
#
# How to verify locally:
#   trivy config --severity HIGH,CRITICAL .
#
# No exceptions are pre-populated: the GCP misconfiguration IDs (AVD-GCP-*) that
# actually fire must be confirmed against the first CI scan, then added here one
# per line with a justification. Until then the gate enforces all HIGH/CRITICAL.
#
# Example format (uncomment and justify a real ID after the first scan):
# # Cloud SQL public IP is disabled, but <reason> ... (ARCHITECTURE.md §N)
# AVD-GCP-0XXX
